ALVA — Completely Remove Shield Walking and Make Ground Shield Stationary

Objective

Implement a complete removal of the Shield Walking mechanic in the Alva fighting game.

Desired behavior: Match the stationary guarding behavior requested from Warriors of the Universe. When a fighter raises their Shield, they must be unable to walk or voluntarily move horizontally until they lower it.

This must be a permanent, universal gameplay change for every playable fighter, every control method, and the CPU.

Do not merely reduce the Shield’s movement speed or hide its animation. Remove the underlying feature, its configuration, its dedicated state, its visual enhancements, and its active documentation.

Preserve all unrelated Shield, combat, movement, and physics systems.

